      "side": 1,
      "message": "This patch is intended to address the synchronization issue where the window\u0027s transparent region (punch-through hole) fails to track a View\u0027s movement during property animations (e.g., rotation, scale, or translation).\n﻿\nDetailed background and reproduction steps can be found in the following issue: https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/467179141",
